{"id":"72b587eaf1edf078","group":"56","path":"56/56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution.md","title":"λ同时归约与无捕获替换相容","display":"lem-lambda-parallel-substitution — λ同时归约与无捕获替换相容","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution","aliases":["56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution"],"display":"lem-lambda-parallel-substitution — λ同时归约与无捕获替换相容","depends_on":["[[56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction]]","[[56-df-lambda-substitution]]"],"source_status":"local-dependency-completion-from-provided-formal-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-lambda-parallel-substitution — λ同时归约与无捕获替换相容"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"752f53ceb23d931c\" href=\"?note=752f53ceb23d931c\" title=\"56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction\">56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"96add5833bb7dcac\" href=\"?note=96add5833bb7dcac\" title=\"56-df-lambda-substitution\">56-df-lambda-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-dependency-completion-from-provided-formal-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"752f53ceb23d931c\" href=\"?note=752f53ceb23d931c\" title=\"56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction\">56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction</a> 的无类型无常元实例，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)\">\\(\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_\\lambda\\subseteq\\Lambda^2\">\\(\\Rightarrow_\\lambda\\subseteq\\Lambda^2\\)</span> 为其中的同时归约。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,M&#39;,N,N&#39;\\in\\Lambda\">\\(M,M&#39;,N,N&#39;\\in\\Lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[x:=N]=\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,\\varnothing,V^2}(M,x,N)\">\\(M[x:=N]=\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,\\varnothing,V^2}(M,x,N)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"96add5833bb7dcac\" href=\"?note=96add5833bb7dcac\" title=\"56-df-lambda-substitution\">56-df-lambda-substitution</a> 的商上无捕获替换；其代表元独立性、改名规则和输入域沿用该内部定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(M\\Rightarrow_\\lambda M&#39;\\land N\\Rightarrow_\\lambda N&#39;\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow M[x:=N]\\Rightarrow_\\lambda M&#39;[x:=N&#39;].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(M\\Rightarrow_\\lambda M&#39;\\land N\\Rightarrow_\\lambda N&#39;\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow M[x:=N]\\Rightarrow_\\lambda M&#39;[x:=N&#39;].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本引理补齐输入中 λ 三角定理仅以“同时替换引理10.2.2”引用而未提供正文的必要接口；不添加其他归约关系，也不改变既有同时归约和替换的定义。</p>\n<p>证明对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\Rightarrow_\\lambda M&#39;\">\\(M\\Rightarrow_\\lambda M&#39;\\)</span> 的有限推导归纳。变量等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 时结论就是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\Rightarrow_\\lambda N&#39;\">\\(N\\Rightarrow_\\lambda N&#39;\\)</span>；其他变量保持不动。应用分支组合两个归纳结论。抽象分支先将绑定变量改名为同时避开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 及两边代入项自由变量的新鲜变量，再对抽象体用归纳假设。根 β 分支同样先选择新鲜绑定变量，对函数体与实参分别使用归纳假设，再用同时归约的根 β 构造；两次无捕获替换的交换等式由替换递归逐构造得到。不同新鲜变量选择只改变 α 代表元，故结论在给定商上成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"752f53ceb23d931c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lambda-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"96add5833bb7dcac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-lambda-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"752f53ceb23d931c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction]] 的无类型无常元实例，令 $\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)$，$\\Rightarrow_\\lambda\\subseteq\\Lambda^2$ 为其中的同时归约。$M,M',N,N'\\in\\Lambda$，$x\\in V$。$M[x:=N]=\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,\\varnothing,V^2}(M,x,N)$ 为 [[56-df-lambda-substitution]] 的商上无捕获替换；其代表元独立性、改名规则和输入域沿用该内部定义。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lambda-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"96add5833bb7dcac","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction]] 的无类型无常元实例，令 $\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)$，$\\Rightarrow_\\lambda\\subseteq\\Lambda^2$ 为其中的同时归约。$M,M',N,N'\\in\\Lambda$，$x\\in V$。$M[x:=N]=\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,\\varnothing,V^2}(M,x,N)$ 为 [[56-df-lambda-substitution]] 的商上无捕获替换；其代表元独立性、改名规则和输入域沿用该内部定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow_\\lambda\\subseteq\\Lambda^2","display":false},{"tex":"M,M',N,N'\\in\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"M[x:=N]=\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,\\varnothing,V^2}(M,x,N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl(M\\Rightarrow_\\lambda M'\\land N\\Rightarrow_\\lambda N'\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow M[x:=N]\\Rightarrow_\\lambda M'[x:=N'].","display":true},{"tex":"M\\Rightarrow_\\lambda M'","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"N\\Rightarrow_\\lambda N'","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":1903,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-294","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution.md]]"},{"id":"52fbf9496f872506","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)$，$M,N\\in\\Lambda$。同时归约 $\\Rightarrow_\\lambda$ 与完全展开 $(-)^\\star$ 见 [[56-df-lambda-complete-development]]；根收缩所需的同时替换接口见 [[56-lem-lambda-parallel-substitution]]。"}],"outgoing":["752f53ceb23d931c","96add5833bb7dcac"]}